  "description": "For her lover of 10 years, belle of the ball Julia Rapiere played the part of a sheltered flower in a greenhouse. That is, until he betrayed her by having an affair with her trusted maid. Bent on revenge, Julia reveals her true colors, and the demure flower transforms into a fearsome monster. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
